  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdtvdssdf1c_m5pA1m87S-3nEL24_RxzjckpI5WTjI64Qftn05GHrdAhOTsB_1Lmcj7nYs6q_8xs9__R-WYWYYdjTzvam8UIZyCiRWmV3NeuIerW6f1xqEuzKbLSMAK4rNe-F9XLyoapmB/s1200/%25E8%25AE%2580%25E5%25AF%25AB%25E7%258F%25AD%25E5%25AD%25B8%25E5%2593%25A1%25E4%25BD%259C%25E5%2593%2581%25E5%2581%259A%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2%25E5%259C%2596.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1032\" data-original-width=\"1200\" height=\"550\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdtvdssdf1c_m5pA1m87S-3nEL24_RxzjckpI5WTjI64Qftn05GHrdAhOTsB_1Lmcj7nYs6q_8xs9__R-WYWYYdjTzvam8UIZyCiRWmV3NeuIerW6f1xqEuzKbLSMAK4rNe-F9XLyoapmB/w640-h550/%25E8%25AE%2580%25E5%25AF%25AB%25E7%258F%25AD%25E5%25AD%25B8%25E5%2593%25A1%25E4%25BD%259C%25E5%2593%2581%25E5%2581%259A%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2%25E5%259C%2596.png\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><b><p><b><br /></b></p>作品名稱</b><p></p><p>Upper Class Jail</p><div><br /></div><p><b>作品簡介</b></p><p>上流家庭，不過是起kah suí-suí ê監獄。</p><p><br /></p><b><p><b>畫圖形式：</b></p></b><p></p><p>電腦畫圖軟體（Clip Studio Paint、Medibang Paint）&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><b>作者簡介：&nbsp;</b></p><p>柯汎柔，中原大學應外系學生，去美國做交換學生ê時tsūn意識著在地ê重要性，別人tī hia是leh練外語，伊suah leh練台語。愛畫圖、看bàng-gà ê「阿宅」 ，先用家己ê專業kap興趣，翻譯台灣歌、畫圖用台語分享，來一點一滴推動母語復興。</p><p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span face=\"&quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif\"><b>台文通訊BONG報326期，2021年5月出刊。</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiAFYqdHd078edB2OiAbYJf79f0aBmftMPI1owU5uF6569X6bgaUAa1ap1Ve_FONYp7xWHXlgBeMgv-WTnua9mzs3UBcCB2RCUOdcRwrR_ni4-aHvWWB8GtzP7BVFD6IQf2PgNb4EAwRvWQ/s1424/326%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiAFYqdHd078edB2OiAbYJf79f0aBmftMPI1owU5uF6569X6bgaUAa1ap1Ve_FONYp7xWHXlgBeMgv-WTnua9mzs3UBcCB2RCUOdcRwrR_ni4-aHvWWB8GtzP7BVFD6IQf2PgNb4EAwRvWQ/w281-h400/326%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"281\" /></a></div><br /><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><b><br /></b></div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　</b></span></div><div><b><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></b></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28